===Format===
* Double Elimination brackets (div1/2)
* Round robin twice (div3)
* All matches are {{abbr|BO5|Best of Five}}
* Pick, Pick, Toss, Toss, Toss, Toss, Pick, Pick, Play
* CMD RND decide who pick first
* Default map pool of 9 maps

